From: Tim Douglas <me@timdoug.com>
Subject: [PATCH] doc: the C33

Its options in invoke.texi (summary, menu and section), its machine
constraints in md.texi and its installation notes in install.texi, each
between Blackfin and the next target, as the order requires.

Signed-off-by: Tim Douglas <me@timdoug.com>

