 @uref{#dos,,DOS}
@@ -4263,6 +4267,31 @@ See ``Blackfin Options'' in the main manual
 More information, and a version of binutils with support for this processor,
 are available at @uref{https://sourceforge.net/projects/adi-toolchain/}.
 
+@html
+<hr />
+@end html
+@anchor{c33-x-elf}
+@heading c33-*-elf
+Seiko Epson S1C33 (C33) processors, without an operating system.  The
+standard, Advanced and PE cores are supported.
+@ifnothtml
+@xref{C33 Options,, C33 Options, gcc, Using the GNU Compiler
+Collection (GCC)},
+@end ifnothtml
+@ifhtml
+See ``C33 Options'' in the main manual
+@end ifhtml
+for a list of C33-specific options.
+
+@html
+<hr />
+@end html
+@anchor{c33-x-linux-musl}
+@heading c33-*-linux-musl
+No-MMU Linux on the C33 PE core, with musl as the C library.
+Programs and shared libraries are FDPIC ELF: the compiler defaults to
+@option{-mcore=c33pe} and @option{-mfdpic}.
+
 @html
 <hr />
 @end html
